1,"px":13,"x":1723.5,"y":435.9,"cell":1921,"i":46,"name":"Dungeon","tags":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2842621801921\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2842621801921\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f409","type":"lake-monsters","dy":48,"x":760.31,"y":657.58,"cell":3950,"i":47,"name":"Lympstabrid Monster","tags":[],"note":"Tales say a relic monster of 10 ft long inhabits Lympstabrid Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":558.45,"y":192.62,"cell":224,"i":48,"name":"Causter Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 27 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":1005.7,"y":351.8,"cell":1352,"i":49,"name":"Alton Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":1110.9,"y":570.78,"cell":3243,"i":50,"name":"Foretersho Monster","tags":[],"note":"Tipplers speak of a golden Monster who inhabits Foretersho hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":970.62,"y":409.93,"cell":1772,"i":51,"name":"Bolbergen Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Huisan Deities."},{"icon":"glyph-1f334","type":"sacred-palm-groves","px":13,"x":1267.17,"y":654.71,"cell":3975,"i":52,"name":"Songuillelo Palm Grove","tags":[],"note":"A palm grove sacred to local Albrid Beliefs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":653.41,"y":296.38,"cell":1064,"i":53,"name":"Sanhadoeira Snakes","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":217.09,"y":236.91,"cell":524,"i":54,"name":"Agapinho Scorpions","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1306.1,"y":738.93,"cell":4473,"i":55,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1321.98,"y":738.57,"cell":4475,"i":56,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":660.82,"y":367.49,"cell":1488,"i":57,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1118.5,"y":188.6,"cell":156,"i":58,"name":"Wickneth Monolith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1a\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc38𐠱\ud802𐠣\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠠\udc1c\udc1f\udc22\udc1f\udc12\udc1e𐠿\ud802𐠥\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠡\udc1c𐠢\ud802\ud802 𐠊\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠣\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠸𐠑\udc11𐠅𐠰\udc18𐠐\udc27\udc18\ud802𐠭\udc18 \udc34\udc27\udc0f𐠷\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠘\udc27\udc03𐠪\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠎</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":899.91,"y":467.19,"cell":2237,"i":59,"name":"Tisis Monolith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲾⲸⳔⳤⳲⳎⳔ ⳪ ⳫⲺⳆⲼⳊⲼⳚⳚⳢⳞⲼⳤⳫⳀⳭⳔⳬⳔⲲ ⳊⳬⳞⳄⳃ⳪ⳆⳆⳠ⳧⳩ⳢⳭⳢⲼⳤⳚⳊⲶⲸⳜⲺⳜⳞⳲⳔⳄⲶⳬ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":676.5,"y":270.3,"cell":786,"i":60,"name":"Ruined Castle","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":840.42,"y":530.62,"cell":2847,"i":61,"name":"Ruined Fortification","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":768.8,"y":305.32,"cell":1078,"i":62,"name":"Ondroy Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1606.19,"y":272.67,"cell":926,"i":63,"name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":469.46,"y":203.46,"cell":320,"i":64,"name":"Sobra Melee","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of the greats in Sobra, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":1584.46,"y":684.56,"cell":4169,"i":65,"name":"Sumicali Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Sumicali, offering local gunpowder alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":1046.24,"y":467.4,"cell":2248,"i":66,"name":"Hnifstad Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Presnesia on the road from Thaxted. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":568.19,"y":230.8,"cell":557,"i":67,"name":"Almeiras Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Avaia on the road from Vareiria. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1317.18,"y":557.45,"cell":3141,"i":68,"name":"Geese migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of geese are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1313.99,"y":653.42,"cell":3978,"i":69,"name":"Aumonero Cavern","tags":[],"note":"The Aumonero Cavern. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1724.71,"y":445.95,"cell":2182,"i":70,"name":"Gavegover Cemetery","tags":[],"note":"A sprawling necropolis built withi